{"html": "<section class=\"ec-product-scenarios ec-library-detail-section\" id=\"product-use-scenarios\" data-scene-ver=\"7\" aria-labelledby=\"product-scenario-title\"><p class=\"ec-scenario-kicker\">用途与选型</p><h2 id=\"product-scenario-title\">适用场景建议</h2><p class=\"ec-scenario-role\">不锈钢开瓶 / 倒酒配件</p><div class=\"ec-scenario-grid\"><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/open-air-nightclub/\">户外酒吧 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>不锈钢开瓶件，握把防滑。挂在吧台边随手可取，不用翻抽屉。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/yacht-party-cups/\">游艇派对 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>小件收在抽屉里不滚，晃船也不丢。</p></article><article class=\"ec-scenario-card\"><h3><a href=\"/zh/corporate-gifts/\">企业活动与品牌礼赠 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>配酒具礼盒刚好凑数，成本可控。</p></article></div><div class=\"ec-scenario-check\"><h3>项目确认</h3><p>核对出杯速度、叠放收纳与夜间照明条件；甲板防滑、杯型稳定与船方容器规定；logo 印面、套装组成与包装方式。</p></div><p class=\"ec-scenario-note\">以上为选型建议。请按实际用途审核所选配置与样品。</p><a class=\"ec-scenario-cta\" href=\"/zh/contact/?models=KPQ-025\">讨论 KPQ-025 的应用方案 →</a></section>", "kind": "product"}